# Build context is the repo root for every image (apps/web needs packages/shared, apps/api needs
# packages/* and supabase/migrations). Keep the context small and keep secrets out of it.

**/node_modules
**/.next
**/dist
**/build
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/.turbo
**/.vercel
**/.DS_Store
**/npm-debug.log*

# Never send env files or keys to the builder. *.example files are placeholders and are allowed.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env*.example
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx
**/secrets
**/.supabase

# Not needed inside images
.git
.github
docs
infra/backups
**/*.md
!packages/prompts/**/*.md
